  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Catalytic Fund for Water Resource Accountability in Pakistan (CF-WRAP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OPM is managing a catalytic grants fund to support innovative and scalable water governance and management solutions in Pakistan. Alongside grant making, OPM is providing demand-driven technical assistance to strengthen the capacity of partners and government institutions to sustain these approaches and develop bankable projects for climate finance. OPM also leads the monitoring, evaluation, and learning (MEL) component of the programme, covering the work of implementing partners such as IWMI (on water governance) and WWF (on nature-based solutions).</narrative>
  </description>
